  "lines": {
    "00:13.00": "Don't stay out late, stay away from alcohol, why won't you listen like a ten-year-old?",
    "00:21.10": "I can only laugh, who are they calling a child?",
    "00:29.00": "You don't know my heart that has to say these unpleasant things, I just want to share good words",
    "00:38.00": "Should we stop? Let's just stop",
    "00:42.00": "Every single thing from one to ten is for you, but to you who won't listen, it's just nagging",
    "00:50.00": "Let's stop, let's stop, even just loving takes all my time",
    "01:00.00": "A story from the heart not the head, even if you say you hate it, I can't stop",
    "01:08.90": "Let's stop, let's stop, all I hear is your nagging",
    "01:18.00": "Are you eating on time? Are you staying away from women? I want to be by your side all day",
    "01:28.00": "That's how I feel, I'd be so happy if I could keep you in my pocket",
    "01:36.00": "Our story that can't exist without each other, if anyone heard it they'd laugh and tease us",
    "01:45.00": "Should we stop? Let's stop, every single thing from one to ten is for you",
    "01:53.00": "My words that you won't listen to, to you it's just obvious nagging, let's stop, let's stop",
    "02:01.00": "Even just loving takes all my time, a story from the heart not the head",
    "02:10.00": "Even if you say you hate it I can't stop, let's stop, let's stop",
    "02:19.00": "All I hear is your nagging",
    "02:26.00": "Even when you try to scare me with that look, to me it's just your cute face",
    "02:34.00": "Are you going to keep doing this? I can't hold back anymore, I might really get angry",
    "02:45.00": "A story worth telling even if you say you'll stop loving, the voice of my heart that thinks of you more than anyone",
    "02:53.00": "Even when I'm angry, even when you shout, even your nagging is sweet to me",
    "03:02.00": "A story worth loving, my words that you won't listen to, to you it's just obvious nagging",
    "03:11.00": "Let's stop, let's stop, please trust this heart of mine"
  },
